892..964 Comment "/// The operator\'s turn: at its own world, holding one capability to the"
965..1037 Comment "/// seat\'s, it runs the seat\'s work there and takes the report back. The"
1038..1114 Comment "/// migration spends the capability, and the report crosses because its type"
1115..1136 Comment "/// is marked mobile."
